    Description: "Detection sinh r\u01B0\u01A1ng s\u1EDBm h\u01A1n; chest pulse d\xF9ng
      event m\u1EDF r\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EADt. Proc kh\xF4ng t\u1EF1 chain."
    ItemIds:
    - treasure-whisper
    - chest-thunder
  - Id: signature-harvest
    Name: "M\xC1Y THU HO\u1EA0CH"
    Description: "Enemy kill \u2192 coin \u2192 logical pickup \u2192 Receipt (0.35s)
      \u2192 Bell cadence \u2192 delayed wave. Bell + Receipt \u0111\xE3 ho\u1EA1t
      \u0111\u1ED9ng, kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EE7 set. Carbon n\u1ED1i wave \u2192
      weakness (Lens m\u1EDBi t\u0103ng crit damage); Stamp burst \u2192 h\xFAt coin
      ph\u1EA1m vi 2.5. Pickup kh\xF4ng t\u1EF1 sinh ti\u1EC1n, secondary kh\xF4ng
      charge prop/proc."
    ItemIds:
    - harvest-receipt
    - carbon-ribbon
  - Id: signature-office
    Name: "V\u0102N PH\xD2NG HO\xC0N TR\u1EA2"
    Description: "Stamp \u2192 Ink (d\u1EA5u nhanh h\u01A1n nh\u01B0ng ng\u1EAFn
      h\u01A1n) \u2192 threshold burst \u2192 weakness 1.8s \u2192 Lens h\u01B0\u1EDFng
      crit. Stamp + Ink \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 payoff cadence; Lens h\u1EEFu \xEDch v\u1EDBi
      m\u1ECDi ally crit tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi \u0111\u1EE7 build. Carbon n\u1ED1i
      Stamp burst \u2192 coin collection cho Harvest. D\u1EA5u truy\u1EC1n tier kh\xF4ng
      t\u1EF1 burst, crit kh\xF4ng t\u1EA1o stamp l\u1EA1i."
    ItemIds:
    - reflective-ink
    - office-lens
    - carbon-ribbon
  - Id: signature-tea
    Name: "TR\xC0 \xC1C M\u1ED8NG"
    Description: Tea + Hammer works via burning targets and third-hit steam; Coaster
      widens weaker tea; Thermal links marks to heat with cooldown.
    ItemIds:
    - tea-coaster
    - thermal-ink
  - Id: signature-chorus
    Name: "D\xC0N H\u1EE2P X\u01AF\u1EDANG"
    Description: Music Box + Record echoes every third note. Music extends live marks;
      Carbon bell exposes targets. Each echo ends, never echoes itself.
    ItemIds:
